# `header X exists` / `!exists` check presence: a missing header does not exist.
# /headers sets X-Request-Id and two Set-Cookie headers.

exitcode 0 hitspec run ok.http
stdout 'Tests: 1 passed, 1 total'

-- ok.http --
### header-presence
GET {{$env(SERVER)}}/headers

>>>
expect header X-Request-Id exists
expect header x-request-id exists
expect header Set-Cookie exists
expect header X-Nope !exists
<<<
